sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over User,LocalFS: Flow 1: RAG Optimization Experiment

    participant User as User<br/>(Notebook / Script)
    participant AI4RAG as ai4rag Library<br/>(in-process)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MaaS as MaaS Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant VectorStore as Vector Store<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Neo4j)
    participant LocalFS as Local Filesystem

    User->>AI4RAG: AI4RAGExperiment.run()<br/>(Python API)
    AI4RAG->>S3: Download documents<br/>TLS, AWS credentials
    S3-->>AI4RAG: Document artifacts

    loop HPO iterations (GAM / Random Search)
        AI4RAG->>AI4RAG: Chunk documents<br/>(docling / LangChain)
        AI4RAG->>MaaS: Generate embeddings<br/>TLS, API key
        MaaS-->>AI4RAG: Embedding vectors
        AI4RAG->>VectorStore: Index chunks<br/>TLS, Token/Password
        VectorStore-->>AI4RAG: Index confirmation
        AI4RAG->>VectorStore: Retrieve relevant chunks<br/>TLS, Token/Password
        VectorStore-->>AI4RAG: Retrieved documents
        AI4RAG->>MaaS: Generate response<br/>TLS, API key
        MaaS-->>AI4RAG: LLM completion
        AI4RAG->>MaaS: Evaluate (LLM-as-Judge)<br/>TLS, API key
        MaaS-->>AI4RAG: Evaluation scores
    end

    AI4RAG->>LocalFS: Write results + starter kit ZIP
    AI4RAG-->>User: Optimization results
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
    Note over Client,MaaS2: Flow 2: Agentic RAG Inference (Starter Kit)

    participant Client as Client
    participant StarterKit as Starter Kit<br/>FastAPI 8080/TCP
    participant AuthWrapper as Auth Wrapper<br/>(ASGI Middleware)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MaaS2 as MaaS Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant VS2 as Vector Store

    Client->>StarterKit: POST /v1/responses<br/>Bearer token
    StarterKit->>AuthWrapper: Validate token
    AuthWrapper->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>TLS, Bearer token
    K8sAPI-->>AuthWrapper: Authentication result
    AuthWrapper-->>StarterKit: Authorized

    StarterKit->>VS2: Retrieve context<br/>TLS, Token/Password
    VS2-->>StarterKit: Relevant documents
    StarterKit->>MaaS2: Chat completion<br/>TLS, API key
    MaaS2-->>StarterKit: LLM response

    opt Query rewriting (AgenticRAG)
        StarterKit->>MaaS2: Rewrite query<br/>TLS, API key
        MaaS2-->>StarterKit: Rewritten query
        StarterKit->>VS2: Re-retrieve<br/>TLS, Token/Password
        VS2-->>StarterKit: Updated context
        StarterKit->>MaaS2: Final generation<br/>TLS, API key
        MaaS2-->>StarterKit: Final response
    end

    StarterKit-->>Client: JSON response<br/>(OpenAI Responses format)
    end
